      <div class="section__text">
        <td>Denim weight determines denim jacket structure, durability, and seasonal suitability. Heavier denim provides more structure and durability but increases garment weight, while lighter denim offers comfort and flexibility for warmer seasons. We offer three primary denim weight options for denim jackets, each optimized for different applications and market segments.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="comparison-wrapper">
        <table class="comparison">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Weight</th>
              <th>Characteristics</th>
              <th>Season</th>
