        <p>Classic trucker jackets feature traditional construction with pointed yokes, button-front closures, dual chest pockets with flaps, and waist pockets. This style originated as workwear but has become a fashion staple. Oversized denim jackets feature drop shoulders, extended lengths, and relaxed silhouettes for streetwear positioning. Cropped denim jackets offer shorter lengths for contemporary styling and layering versatility. Fashion denim jackets incorporate unique design elements, unconventional cuts, or hybrid construction for brand differentiation.</p>
