        <p>Private label process begins with brand consultation to understand positioning, target market, and aesthetic preferences. We develop designs or work with your provided designs, create samples for approval, and scale to production upon confirmation. Brand elements including logos, labels, hang tags, and packaging are integrated into production. The final product carries your brand exclusively, enabling brand building and customer loyalty.</p>
        
