        <p>Button options include metal buttons in brass, nickel, and black nickel finishes for authentic workwear aesthetics, plastic buttons for cost efficiency, and custom branded buttons for brand identity. Rivets at stress points reinforce construction and add authentic detailing. YKK zippers in various colors provide reliable closure functionality, with custom zipper pulls offering branding opportunities. Hardware selection should balance authenticity, durability, and aesthetic considerations.</p>
        
        <p>Construction details include double-stitched seams at stress points for durability, bar-tacking at pocket corners to prevent separation, and reinforced stitching at yoke seams and shoulder joints. These construction techniques ensure denim jackets withstand regular wear while maintaining structural integrity. Quality control includes testing hardware functionality and seam strength before bulk production.</p>
