  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="section__container">
      <div class="section__header">
        <span class="section__label">Oversized Denim Jackets</span>
        <div class="accent-line"></div>
        <h2 class="section__title">Oversized Denim Jackets for Streetwear</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section__text">
        <td>Oversized denim jackets have become a streetwear staple, offering relaxed silhouettes that align with contemporary fashion preferences. The oversized aesthetic features drop shoulders, extended lengths, wider bodies, and relaxed fits that prioritize comfort and visual impact over tailored construction. This style requires specialized pattern grading to achieve the intended fit while maintaining structural integrity.</p>
        
        <p>Oversized construction differs from standard sizing in several key areas. Shoulder seams are dropped 2-3 inches from standard placement for the relaxed shoulder line. Body width is increased significantly for the oversized silhouette. Length is extended beyond standard proportions for dramatic effect. Sleeve width and length are increased proportionally to maintain balanced proportions. Despite the relaxed fit, construction must maintain structural integrity at stress points including shoulders, pockets, and seams.</p>
        
        <p>Oversized denim jackets are particularly popular in streetwear and contemporary fashion markets. The relaxed silhouette aligns with current trends favoring comfort and oversized proportions. Brands targeting younger demographics or streetwear segments often prioritize oversized styles in their denim jacket offerings. We produce oversized denim jackets from 300 pieces minimum, with pattern grading optimized for the intended oversized fit while ensuring quality consistency across sizes.</p>
