        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What is your minimum order for denim jackets?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Our denim jacket minimum is 300 pieces per style. This applies to trucker, oversized, cropped, and fashion denim jackets. Minimum can be split across sizes within a single colorway. Lower quantities available at higher per-piece cost for sampling and prototype development. Volume discounts available.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
