        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">What hardware options do you offer for denim jackets?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Hardware options include metal buttons in brass, nickel, and black nickel finishes, metal rivets for authentic construction, YKK zippers in various colors, and custom zipper pulls with branding. Hardware selection impacts both authenticity and aesthetic positioning. All hardware tested for durability before bulk production.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="faq__item">
          <h3 class="faq__question">Can you produce oversized denim jackets?</h3>
          <p class="faq__answer">Yes. We produce oversized denim jackets with drop shoulders, extended lengths, and relaxed silhouettes for streetwear positioning. Oversized construction requires pattern grading for the intended fit while maintaining structural integrity. Popular for contemporary streetwear brands seeking relaxed aesthetics.</p>
        </div>
        
