          <p class="faq__answer">Standard production timeline: 35-45 days from fabric receipt for basic denim jackets. 45-60 days for custom washes and treatments. 10-14 days for sampling before bulk. Wash development adds 5-10 days. Rush production available at 20-30% premium for urgent deadlines.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cta">
    <div class="section__container">
      <h2 class="section__title">Ready to Order Custom Denim Jackets?</h2>
      <p class="section__text">
        Contact SDF Clothing for custom denim jacket manufacturing. We provide detailed quotes, production timelines, and sample development. Trucker, oversized, cropped, and fashion denim jackets from 300 pieces minimum. Stone wash, acid wash, and private label production available.
      </p>
      <div class="section__ctas">
        <a href="/contact/" class="section__cta section__cta--primary">Get Free Quote</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="section__cta section__cta--secondary">Request Sample</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section__container">
      <p class="section__text--small">
        Related pages: <a href="/denim-manufacturer" style="color: var(--color-primary);">denim manufacturer</a>, <a href="/jacket-manufacturer" style="color: var(--color-primary);">jacket manufacturer</a>, <a href="/bomber-jacket-manufacturer" style="color: var(--color-primary);">bomber jacket manufacturer</a>, <a href="/low-moq-clothing-manufacturers/" style="color: var(--color-primary);">low MOQ clothing manufacturers</a>, <a href="/private-label-clothing-manufacturer" style="color: var(--color-primary);">private label manufacturer</a>, <a href="/dyeing-service" style="color: var(--color-primary);">dyeing service</a>, <a href="/streetwear-manufacturer" style="color: var(--color-primary);">streetwear manufacturer</a>, <a href="/clothing-manufacturer-bangladesh" style="color: var(--color-primary);">clothing manufacturer Bangladesh</a>, <a href="/certifications" style="color: var(--color-primary);">certifications</a>, <a href="/contact/" style="color: var(--color-primary);">contact</a>, <a href="/contact/" style="color: var(--color-primary);">sample request</a>.
